# .agent/guard-rules — repo-specific deny rules for the night-shift guard.
# One POSIX extended regex per line; matched against every Bash command the
# agent runs during autonomous runs. '#' starts a comment.
# Company/workspace conventions belong HERE — never in the plugin itself.
#
# Example (this workspace): restores may only target databases prefixed drill_
# pg_restore.*-d[[:space:]]+(?!drill_)   <-- ERE has no lookahead; write it positively:
# pg_restore[[:space:]].*-d[[:space:]]+(pcu_|prod)
